        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-ba2c3be6-4712-4e3d-8016-69fd81ac9220",
        "text": "###Start with a plan.\n\nDecide who your page is for, what belongs on it, and what visitors should be able to do.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/8394606fbac99808bd9afa51ee0652b9-Planning a Web Page Layout-1.png",
