      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-4f32facc-9d3a-417d-8506-7b147ed7a6e3",
        "text": "####Compare the result to your plan.\n\nCheck the content, layout, and features. What matches? What’s missing or different?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/fc4ea1d7455395b59c82ec350ea55d76-Plan versus browser_ spot the mismatch-2.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
