      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-4e6e7a97-d8fc-4458-aa16-afc16e2b48c4",
        "text": "###Keep what works.\n\nIf the page meets your goals and works when you test it, you can keep it as is.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/c17aeb4d1f7e4d09059b1ae52991fac9-From wrong page to right layout-3.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
