      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-keep-or-redirect-7-4d59d49f-ef73-4664-89c5-db39ed61e775",
        "text": "####You decide what to keep!\n\nWrite a new prompt that explains what missed the mark, what to change, and what to keep.",
